          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ごとの抽選%lld回（%@）" : {
      "comment" : "Completion card: a long focus drew once per 250 g. %1$@ is 250g, %2$lld the draws, %3$@ the outcomes (通常1・金1). en: 'One draw per %1$@: %2$lld (%3$@)'",
